{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226550","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226550","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422655001:1":{"text":"この場所は、私の想像とだいぶ違っていたよ。","source_cn":"这里，真是与我想象得格外不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80A7ED5F74AB795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422655002:1":{"text":"ある程度予想はしていたが、ここまでサロクディアとかけ離れているとは思わなかった。","source_cn":"尽管我已经做过心理准备，知道此处会与萨洛克兰大相径庭，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF038E72F761BE377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422655003:1":{"text":"ここは、何もかもが気軽で、自由で、喜びに満ちている。","source_cn":"这里的一切都是如此的，轻松，自由而又愉快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22D8AD882C75DBE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422655004:1":{"text":"気を抜けない時や、揉め事もそれなりにあるがな。","source_cn":"也有紧张，同样也少不了纠纷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF39F10A50814C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422655005:1":{"text":"私たちもまた、身勝手や嫉妬、嘘、傷つけ合いといった世俗の業からは逃れられない。","source_cn":"自私、嫉妒、欺骗、伤害，我们并不能免俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4065BFD14C294F99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_titl